### Regulations API Tests — PravahOS
### Requires: login first via auth.http (admin) to set cookies

# -------------------------------------------------------
# 1. UPLOAD — multipart PDF upload
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Upload a PDF regulation (admin)
POST http://localhost:8000/regulations/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ../../docs/plans/2026-07-27-pravahos-mvp.md
------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Cyber Security Circular
------boundary--

### Upload without authentication (expect 401)
POST http://localhost:8000/regulations/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

test content
------boundary--

### Upload non-PDF file (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8000/regulations/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----boundary

------boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

This is not a PDF
------boundary


# -------------------------------------------------------
# 2. LIST — get all regulations
# -------------------------------------------------------

### List all regulations
GET http://localhost:8000/regulations/


# -------------------------------------------------------
# 3. GET BY ID — get single regulation
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Get regulation by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/regulations/{{regulation_id}}

### Get nonexistent regulation (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8000/regulations/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


# -------------------------------------------------------
# 4. INGEST — extract clauses + classify
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Ingest regulation (extract clauses, classify)
POST http://localhost:8000/regulations/{{regulation_id}}/ingest


# -------------------------------------------------------
# 5. GENERATE — run 4-agent pipeline to create MAPs
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Generate MAPs from regulation
POST http://localhost:8000/regulations/{{regulation_id}}/generate


# -------------------------------------------------------
# 6. GRAPH — get dependency graph data
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Get dependency graph
GET http://localhost:8000/regulations/{{regulation_id}}/graph


# -------------------------------------------------------
# 7. SIMULATE — run Monte Carlo Digital Twin
# -------------------------------------------------------

### Run simulation (100 iterations)
GET http://localhost:8000/regulations/{{regulation_id}}/simulate
